      "text": "Carry the lantern with no flame to the summit and unmask the Usurper."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.quests.usurper.inscription",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "頂點",
      "text": "攜無焰提燈前往頂點，揭穿篡位者的面具。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.variants.ownShade2.deathDialogue",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "spire",
      "text": "Each climber leaves a shape behind. The Spire has learned to wear ours."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.variants.ownShade2.deathDialogue",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "climb",
      "text": "Each climber leaves a shape behind. The Spire has learned to wear ours."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.variants.ownShade2.deathDialogue",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "尖塔",
      "text": "每位朝聖者都留下一道形影。尖塔已學會披上我們的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.variants.ownShade3.deathDialogue",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "above",
      "text": "Above the Sovereign there is no dawn — only a door pretending to be the sky."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.variants.ownShade3.deathDialogue",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "之上",
      "text": "永恆君王之上沒有破曉——只有一扇偽裝成天空的門。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.vows.3.desc",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "climb",
      "text": "You climb already cursed — begin every run with a Hex."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.0",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "spire",
      "text": "There is a colour the Spire refuses to name."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.0",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "尖塔",
      "text": "有一種顏色，尖塔拒絕為它命名。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.17",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "upward",
      "text": "The Pale Ones are not hunting you. They are pointing upward."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.17",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "向上",
      "text": "蒼白眾並非在獵你。他們在向上指。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.18",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "stair",
      "text": "The Sovereign is a mask worn below the final stair."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.18",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "階梯",
      "text": "永恆君王只是在最終階梯之下披上的面具。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.19",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "summit",
      "text": "When six panes burn, look beyond the summit."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.19",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "頂點",
      "text": "當六片窗片燃起，望向頂點之外。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.20",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "above",
      "text": "There is a sealed door above the crown."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.20",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
      "term": "之上",
      "text": "王冠之上有一扇封印之門。"
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.23",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "climb",
      "text": "The climb continues."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.3",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "climb",
      "text": "The dead climb twice: once in flesh, once in memory."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.6",
      "locale": "en",
      "term": "summit",
      "text": "A page can be read only after it survives the summit."
    },
    {
      "key": "content.whispers.6",
      "locale": "zh-Hant",
